          "settings": {
            "heading": "PRODUCT DESCRIPTION LEARN MORE:",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Description for Rain Curtain Pots : Valyrian Designs’ Modern Rain Curtain Pots are a show stopping statement in luxury outdoor living. Designed for both residential and commercial spaces, these innovative water features combine modern design with a tranquil zen ambiance, creating an unforgettable focal point in any setting.<br/><br/>From luxury homes to spas, restaurants, hotels, and upscale retail spaces, our bespoke rain curtain fountains transform outdoor environments into serene, visually captivating destinations. The gentle sheet of cascading water not only adds a striking architectural element but also promotes Feng Shui harmony and relaxation.<br/><br/><br/>Crafted with high-grade corten steel or available in custom powder-coated colors, each piece is made to order with the Valyrian commitment to exceptional craftsmanship. Whether you are designing a modern backyard oasis or creating a signature resort feature, our rain curtain pot designs are engineered to withstand the elements while elevating your space with artistry and innovation.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
